# File Placement (inventory-app)

## Rule

This is a **standalone** Laravel app extracted from the monolith. There is **no** `Modules/` directory.

| What | Where |
|------|--------|
| Application logic | `app/Application/` |
| Domain models / contracts | `app/Domain/` |
| External APIs, observers, jobs | `app/Infrastructure/` |
| Controllers, Form Requests, Artisan | `app/Presentation/` |
| SPA | `resources/frontend/src/` |
| Migrations / seeders | `database/migrations/`, `database/seeders/` |
| Tests | `tests/Feature/`, `tests/Unit/` |
| Agent docs | `CLAUDE.md`, `.cursor/rules/` |

## Forbidden

```
❌ Modules/...
❌ app/Modules/...
❌ Creating parallel "inventory2" trees
❌ Business logic only in public/ without backend service when ledger/stock is involved
```

## Examples

```
✅ app/Application/Services/MarketplaceImportService.php
✅ app/Domain/Models/Wms/InventoryOrder.php
✅ app/Presentation/Http/Controllers/Api/MarketplaceOrderController.php
✅ resources/frontend/src/components/inventory/OrderImportDialog.tsx
```
